# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows checks out CRLF while Biome formats to LF, so
# `biome ci` reports every file as entirely changed. Locally that was invisible:
# `biome check --write` rewrote the working tree to LF and exited clean, then
# Git converted it back on the next checkout. CI failed on all 53 files from the
# first run for this reason alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.woff2 binary
